      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8381803997503107674, guid: ecb50d97091b9c54cae541f86a929a07, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Her presence is the whisper before the fall, the last breath before
        silence.\r\n\r\nRaised in the hidden mountain enclave of the Kitsune Clan,
        Ichi of the hidden blade was trained from childhood in the ancient arts of
        stealth, sabotage, and survival.\r\n\r\nBut Ichi was never content to follow
        tradition; she sought mastery, not obedience. Years of training and countless
        missions had made her the clan\u2019s most feared operative, yet she did
        not cling to fame. She remained reclusive and reluctant to involve herself
        in the clan\u2019s work for the new governments or be contracted by crime
        syndicates.\r\n\r\nThough she has earned her place among legends, Ichi remains
        elusive, driven not by glory but by an obsession with perfection. She values
        all things aesthetic and orderly, and holds reverence for the discipline
        of the ninja arts."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8381803997503107674, guid: ecb50d97091b9c54cae541f86a929a07, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_fontSize
      value: 21.65
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    m_RemovedComponents: []
    m_RemovedGameObjects: []
    m_AddedGameObjects: []
    m_AddedComponents: []
  m_SourcePrefab: {fileID: 100100000, guid: ecb50d97091b9c54cae541f86a929a07, type: 3}
