    - target: {fileID: 8381803997503107674, guid: ecb50d97091b9c54cae541f86a929a07, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'A relic of the prior war, Monk was once an honorable general and a
        mighty warrior.


        Tales of his feats were surreal until you met him
        on the battlefield. With each battle, his fame and wealth grew. He was considered
        the greatest warrior in the nation for a time, that was until he encountered
        Fraug. In one decisive stroke, Monk was defeated and, in the process, lost
        his arm.


        With his pride as a warrior lost, Monk resigned from his
        position and recused himself into the mountains. For three straight years,
        Monk trained tirelessly until he could one day wield his sword normally again.


        Now
        he roams the land, searching for Fraug to challenge him once again for the
        title of greatest warrior.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8381803997503107674, guid: ecb50d97091b9c54cae541f86a929a07, type: 3}
