      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8381803997503107674, guid: ecb50d97091b9c54cae541f86a929a07, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Captain of the Royal Guard, Bluetail was born into a life shaped by
        power and legacy.\r\n\r\nThe daughter of a general and a captain, she was
        molded by their discipline and driven by their expectations. From her earliest
        days, the art of war was her inheritance... steel, strategy, and unyielding
        will.\r\n\r\nThrough years of grueling training and relentless pursuit of
        perfection, Bluetail rose above all challengers, becoming the youngest warrior
        ever indoctrinated into the Royal Guard. On the battlefield, her spear became
        legend, striking with a precision and fury few could comprehend, let alone
        match.\r\n\r\nThough she has long since proven worthy of her parents\u2019
        legacy, Bluetail remains in constant pursuit of perfection: ever striving,
        ever pushing, a warrior determined to surpass both her parents and become
        a legend for the ages."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8381803997503107674, guid: ecb50d97091b9c54cae541f86a929a07, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_fontSize
      value: 21.1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
