    - target: {fileID: 8381803997503107674, guid: ecb50d97091b9c54cae541f86a929a07, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Grandmaster of the School of the Flaming Fist, Chaolin is the living
        embodiment of a controlled firestorm.\r\n\r\nSerene on the surface, yet with
        a furnace of fury smoldering beneath. His calm smile masks an intensity so
        fierce it can make the mightiest adversaries tremble.\r\n\r\nIn his youth,
        Chaolin was quick to anger and quicker to strike. His ruthlessness propelled
        him through the Yakuza\u2019s ranks until he stood among its most feared
        lieutenants. But during a job, fate intervened. He and his crew were effortlessly
        dismantled by a lone monk, the prior Grandmaster of the School. Shamed and
        burning for redemption, Chaolin challenged the master to a rematch. The terms
        were simple: if he lost again, he would forsake the Yakuza and submit himself
        as a disciple.\r\n\r\nDefeat came swiftly, yet it paved the way for his transformation.
        Under his master\u2019s guidance, Chaolin forged discipline from his rage,
        shaping it into an unyielding weapon.\r\n\r\nNow, as the Grandmaster himself,
        he carries the torch of his mentor\u2019s teachings. Rehabilitating delinquents,
        ruffians, and lost souls, instilling in them the ultimate truth: control
        your emotions\u2026 or they will control you."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8381803997503107674, guid: ecb50d97091b9c54cae541f86a929a07, type: 3}
